cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this template in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Strategus Study Template"
abstract: >
  A GitHub template repository for Strategus-based observational studies on an
  OMOP CDM v5.4 SQL Server database. Cohorts are declarative circe definitions
  executed by the OHDSI HADES Strategus framework, with a pinned renv
  environment, a cohort manifest, and documented workspace conventions
  (including a circe escape hatch) distilled from defects encountered in real
  study runs. Layers on, and credits, OHDSI's upstream StrategusStudyRepoTemplate.
  Funding: Research reported in this publication was supported by the National
  Center For Advancing Translational Sciences of the National Institutes of Health
  under Award Number K12TR005435. The content is solely the responsibility of the
  authors and does not necessarily represent the official views of the National
  Institutes of Health.
